e and Aussie capex surged, so AUDCAD returns to 'could get even stronger'.|Tamura's hawkish turn gives NZDJPY a bearish scenario for the first time this week.|The franc's fear premium cooled, and NZDCHF stays just inside two-sided territory.|Wall Street's recovery removed the deeper risk-off threat, so NZDCAD's bullish read regains its footing.|Tamura's hawkish speech could make CADJPY's bearish read even stronger.|Oil helped the loonie, but CADCHF's bearish read is not threatened.|Tamura gives the yen a hawkish card, and CHFJPY's stand-off now has a scenario each way.|Falling Treasury yields gave gold a softer backdrop, but XAUUSD's gold factor is unchanged.")
